{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "本土化是电视发展的正途  (Localization Is Television's True Path)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping aside with Chun Yuqiao after the meeting, Wen Simo delivers a solemn man-to-man warning to treat Xin Huimei's feelings with care and promises policy support at DTS, while Xingzi reports that talent agencies are still stonewalling Unit One. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么样，老弟，我大概把邓主任吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我倒是觉得，我们董事长像是真给吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美是我最珍惜、也最欣赏的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果你让她受到任何的伤害，那么我闻思默于公于私，都将会成为你最坚决的敌人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我向你保证，男人对男人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不管接受与否，我都会认真地对待辛惠美的情感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "台里那边你放心，我召集了一批专家给政策面上做咨询。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家一致认为本土化是电视发展的正途。你就放心大胆干吧，我保证他们通过改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些人现在全都不接我电话了，估计全都不打算让步了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷那边有什么进展吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我都搞不定，还指望她能攻破啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那可不一定，这个布小谷有的时候路子真是挺野的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么样，老弟，我大概把邓主任吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How was that, brother? I probably gave the network director quite a scare.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我倒是觉得，我们董事长像是真给吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you ask me, our chairwoman looked genuinely startled.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美是我最珍惜、也最欣赏的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei is the woman I cherish and admire most.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果你让她受到任何的伤害，那么我闻思默于公于私，都将会成为你最坚决的敌人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you ever let her get hurt in any way, then professionally and personally I will become your fiercest enemy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我向你保证，男人对男人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I give you my word, man to man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不管接受与否，我都会认真地对待辛惠美的情感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whether I accept her feelings or not, I will treat Xin Huimei's heart with complete sincerity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "台里那边你放心，我召集了一批专家给政策面上做咨询。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't worry about the network; I gathered a panel of scholars to advise leadership on media policy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家一致认为本土化是电视发展的正途。你就放心大胆干吧，我保证他们通过改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone agrees homegrown innovation is television's true path forward — go ahead boldly, and I guarantee they'll approve it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些人现在全都不接我电话了，估计全都不打算让步了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'None of those agency reps will even pick up my calls now — clearly none of them plan to budge.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷那边有什么进展吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has there been any progress on Bu Xiaogu's end?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我都搞不定，还指望她能攻破啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If even I can't crack them, do you really expect her to break through?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那可不一定，这个布小谷有的时候路子真是挺野的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You never know — sometimes Bu Xiaogu has surprisingly bold ways of getting things done.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "怎么样，老弟，我大概把邓主任吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我倒是觉得，我们董事长像是真给吓着了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "辛惠美是我最珍惜、也最欣赏的女人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "如果你让她受到任何的伤害，那么我闻思默于公于私，都将会成为你最坚决的敌人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我向你保证，男人对男人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不管接受与否，我都会认真地对待辛惠美的情感。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "台里那边你放心，我召集了一批专家给政策面上做咨询。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家一致认为本土化是电视发展的正途。你就放心大胆干吧，我保证他们通过改版。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些人现在全都不接我电话了，估计全都不打算让步了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷那边有什么进展吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我都搞不定，还指望她能攻破啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那可不一定，这个布小谷有的时候路子真是挺野的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With advertisers and DTS nearly won over, Chun Yuqiao bets on Bu Xiaogu's unconventional resourcefulness to break the talent-agency deadlock. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
